# Wave T26 (Copperton register): the Travelling Stone — the
# Trainer School's stone, home on its plinth in its court
# between the two shipped fossil displays (tale_rustboro,
# "The Stone That Travels": carried out of Copperton and
# brought home by forty years of departing students). A
# smooth grey river stone on a cut-stone plinth with a small
# brass plaque band. FULLY OPAQUE by design: it stands on
# the cutstone court, whose flags are baked in as its
# ground, never transparency (the T25 scales precedent).
# (WAVE-T26-COPPERTON-PLAN.md, Kit.)
